{"id":"w15295","name":"Albanian Fried Meatballs","author":"Wikibooks Cookbook contributors","source":{"name":"Wikibooks Cookbook","url":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Cookbook:Albanian_Fried_Meatballs"},"via":{"name":"Wikibooks","url":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Cookbook:Albanian_Fried_Meatballs"},"image":"","cuisine":"Albanian","country":"","region":"Europe","course":"side","protein":"other","diet":0,"allergens":3,"minutes":55,"time":{"prep":30,"cook":25,"passive":0,"passiveWhy":[]},"timeEstimated":true,"servings":"4","difficulty":"medium","ingredients":[{"item":"1 slice stale bread","qty":""},{"item":"1 lb ground meat","qty":""},{"item":"1 small onion, finely-grated","qty":""},{"item":"2 tbsp chopped feta cheese","qty":""},{"item":"2 tbsp bread crumbs","qty":""},{"item":"2 tbsp oil or melted butter","qty":""},{"item":"1 tbsp chopped parsley","qty":""},{"item":"Salt","qty":""},{"item":"Pepper","qty":""},{"item":"Mint","qty":""},{"item":"Oregano","qty":""},{"item":"1 cup flour","qty":""},{"item":"1 cup oil (olive oil recommended)","qty":""}],"steps":["Soak bread in water and squeeze hard to drain.","Combine soaked bread, ground meat, bread crumbs, oil or melted butter, onion, cheese, parsley, salt, pepper, and mint, and mix thoroughly.","Form mixture into 1 inch-thick patties, then sprinkle with salt, pepper, and oregano.","Roll in flour and fry in hot oil.","Serve hot with French fries or mashed potatoes."],"tags":[],"youtube":"","culture":null,"license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}